<div class="section wrap">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h1>Get involved</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>You don't need permission or an account to start. Pick whichever of these fits how you've got time and energy to show up right now.</p>

    <h2>Read and share</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Browse the <a href="/knowledgebase/">knowledgebase</a> and try a guide — then tell us what was unclear. That feedback is as valuable as writing a new guide from scratch.</li>
      <li>Subscribe to the <a href="/feed.xml">Atom feed</a> so new writing and guides reach you without checking back.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Contribute knowledge</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Have a method, a fix, or a piece of infrastructure you know well? Write it up — even rough notes are a starting point we can help shape into a guide.</li>
      <li>Know of a project, tool, or community that belongs on the <a href="/links/">links page</a>? Suggest it.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Show up in person</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Work parties, skill-shares, and in-person gatherings will be listed here once we've got a first one scheduled.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="callout">
